    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BUY SECTION -->
<section class="buy-section" id="buy">
  <div class="section-label text-center">Limited Time Offer</div>
  <h2 class="section-title text-center" style="color:white;">Get HydroPaw™ Today</h2>
  <p class="section-sub text-center" style="color:#8896A8; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Join thousands of happy dog owners. Sale ends soon.</p>

  <div class="buy-card fade-in">
    <div class="buy-price-was">$34.99</div>
    <div class="buy-price-now"><sup>$</sup>17.99</div>
    <div class="buy-save">🔥 YOU SAVE $17 — 49% OFF</div>

    <div class="buy-color-opts">
      <label>Select Color</label>
      <div class="buy-color-btns">
        {%- if product != blank -%}
          {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
            <button class="buy-color-btn{% if forloop.first %} active{% endif %}" data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}">{{ variant.title }}</button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <button class="buy-color-btn active">Pink</button>
          <button class="buy-color-btn">Pink Print</button>
          <button class="buy-color-btn">Blue</button>
          <button class="buy-color-btn">Blue Print</button>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="buy-btn-cart">Add to Cart</button>
    <button class="buy-btn-buy">Buy It Now — $17.99</button>

    <div class="buy-payment">
      <span class="pay-badge">VISA</span>
      <span class="pay-badge">MASTERCARD</span>
      <span class="pay-badge">PAYPAL</span>
      <span class="pay-badge">APPLE PAY</span>
      <span class="pay-badge">GOOGLE PAY</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="text-center">
    <div class="section-label">Got Questions?</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What size dogs is this suitable for?<span class="toggle">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">HydroPaw™ works great for small to medium breeds. The 285ml capacity is ideal for dogs up to 40lbs on a standard walk. For larger breeds or longer hikes, we recommend carrying two bottles.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is it dishwasher safe?<span class="toggle">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes! Both the stainless steel body and the silicone sleeve are top-rack dishwasher safe. You can also hand wash with warm soapy water for a quick clean between walks.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Does it actually not leak in a bag?<span class="toggle">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Absolutely. The precision-sealed lid locks shut and has been tested under pressure. You can toss it in any bag, upside down or sideways, and it won't leak a drop.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How long does shipping take?<span class="toggle">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Standard shipping takes 7–14 business days. Expedited options are available at checkout. All orders come with full tracking so you know exactly where your bottle is.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What is your return policy?<span class="toggle">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">We offer a 30-day no-questions-asked return policy. If you or your pup aren't satisfied, contact us and we'll sort out a full refund or replacement — whichever you prefer.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <span class="nav-logo">HydroPaw<sup style="font-size:.5em;color:var(--blue)">™</sup></span>
      <p>Keeping tails wagging and pups hydrated on every adventure since 2024.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col"><h4>Shop</h4><a href="#buy">HydroPaw™ Bottle</a><a href="#buy">Pink Edition</a><a href="#buy">Blue Edition</a></div>
    <div class="footer-col"><h4>Support</h4><a href="#">FAQ</a><a href="#">Shipping Info</a><a href="#">Returns</a><a href="#">Contact Us</a></div>
    <div class="footer-col"><h4>Company</h4><a href="#">About</a><a href="#">Privacy Policy</a><a href="#">Terms of Service</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div>© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} HydroPaw™. All rights reserved.</div>
    <div class="footer-tagline">Made with love for dogs everywhere 🐾</div>
  </div>
</footer>

